        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For Adelise Cotard, the peaceful world of Socotrine is but a stifling prison. While the cost of her yearning may haunt her forever, it will bring her to cross paths with another world of fables and fae. Will her heart whisper to her to preserve that dream, or will it call for her to shatter it as well?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this next entry of the Fallstreak franchise, experience a tale of tragedy spanning over 10 hours, complete with evocative graphics, poignant soundtracks, and carefully crafted prose.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A linear visual novel that delves into the dark origins of dreams and fantasy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features a tailored original soundtrack to immersive yourself in emotional scenes and gripping battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of expressive character sprites enhanced by GFX, as well as both dreamy and nightmarish backgrounds + CGs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features a full length of 115,000 words.</p></li></ul>",
